<!-- 7. PROCESS DIFFERENCE MATRIX -->
<section class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 flex flex-col gap-10">
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-3">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="font-headline text-[11px] font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-primary">
        The Comparison
      </span>
      <div class="h-0.5 w-8 bg-primary/30"></div>
    </div>
    
    <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold uppercase tracking-tight text-on-surface">
      The Contractor Difference
    </h2>
    
    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
      Why piecemeal contracting leads to compounding friction, blown budgets, and compromised quality.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
    <!-- Traditional Method -->
    <div class="bg-surface-container-low p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border border-outline-variant/30 flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 shadow-xs">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-error font-headline">TRADITIONAL PIECEMEAL</span>
          <span class="p-1 rounded-full bg-error-container text-on-error-container">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-xs text-on-surface-variant">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-error font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
            <span>6+ disconnected vendors and subcontractors blaming each other for faults and delays</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-error font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
            <span>Independent architect and builder clash over engineering feasibility and structural assumptions</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-error font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
            <span>Unanticipated cost escalations and variation orders due to missing bill-of-quantities line items</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-error font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
            <span>Client forced into the role of full-time, stressed mediator resolving trade clashes</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Paanya Integrated Execution -->
    <div class="bg-[#071A33] text-on-primary p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl border-2 border-primary/40 shadow-md flex flex-col justify-between gap-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary-fixed font-headline">PAANYA INTEGRATED EXECUTION</span>
          <span class="p-1 rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-xs text-surface-container-high">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-primary-container font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
            <span class="text-white font-medium">Single accountable firm commanding architectural design, structural engineering, and civil execution</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-primary-container font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
            <span>Architectural BIM schematics thoroughly verified against site loads before any foundation pour</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-primary-container font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
            <span>Binding fixed-price milestone contract with locked-in material grades and brand specifications</span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
            <span class="text-primary-container font-bold mt-0.5">•</span>
            <span>Client receives calm, weekly photographic progress updates with zero dispute headaches</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
